  "sourceTitle": "[AINews] Quasi-Riemann-Hypothesis: OpenAI publishes 722 math papers solving 90 of the top 500 open math problems; “the most significant moment” in >100 years of mathematics",
  "sourceBodyHash": "d3c4ba6719eb4f59b341a70d1a97712f0714f89283df41174112ccc82147807a",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "openrouter",
  "requestedModel": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free",
  "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-07T07:16:40.411657Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-07T08:10:50.989209Z",
  "totalBlocks": 98,
  "translatedBlocks": 98,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a26737aec160a2d",
      "translationZh": "AIE NYC 的门票即将售罄！下周见！",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eaa4f58e499e702f",
      "translationZh": "查看过去的 AINews 期刊以获取订阅者折扣。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d705816e47a822be",
      "translationZh": "为 Mistral 倒一杯，他们在最近的 Series D 资助的全新 3800 GB300 集群上发布了一个不错的 Large 4 “Le Chonk” 模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "98c42664a3f2d6cd",
      "translationZh": "但他们被 OpenAI 内部的 Navier-Stokes 数学模型所掩盖——该模型以博客文章、代码库和推文的形式发布。来自 Anthropic 的 Navier-Stokes 竞争者尽管与 OpenAI 有个人分歧，却毫不掩饰地说道：“这显然是数学史上最重要的时刻。”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5106271bb6c8bf62",
      "translationZh": "这虽然有一些限制，但大多数专家似乎同意它解决了数学中前 500 个开放问题中的许多。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e6766b2ef1d2b78",
      "translationZh": "特别是，结果 003，即准黎曼假设，介于菲尔兹奖级别的成果与“过去 200 年数论领域最大的成果”之间。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c56f1b6039e441d9",
      "translationZh": "最令人惊讶的是——Navier-Stokes 用了 88 小时和 10,000 个代理，而这些解决方案平均仅需 3 小时的 ChatGPT Pro。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "696d6c0098fa59c5",
      "translationZh": "AI News 10/5/2026-10/6/2026。我们检查了 12 个 subreddits，544 条 Twitters，没有进一步的 Discords。AINews’ 网站让您可以搜索所有过去的期刊。提醒大家，AINews 现在是 Latent Space 的一个章节。您可以选择订阅或退订邮件频率。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df78d900f5dd8e9c",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI 发布了来自未发布内部模型的 722 份数学手稿",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e315966ad289a48f",
      "translationZh": "发布情况：OpenAI 在一个公开的 GitHub 仓库中发布了一组来自内部前沿模型的广泛数学结果。它表示，在如何发布这些结果方面，它咨询了高等研究院的独立数学与人工智能咨询小组。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4dd1e311a245738b",
      "translationZh": "规模与计算：据报道，该合集包含 722 份手稿，分为 372 个相关结果家族。它们来自对大约 4000 个研究问题的评估，每个结果平均使用了大约 3 小时的 ChatGPT Pro 思考计算（摘要，概览）。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "066fb01fae780c03",
      "translationZh": "产物：发布内容包括论文、证明产物和选定的推理摘要。模型本身仍未发布。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3860444611843b63",
      "translationZh": "框架：Sam Altman 称其为“发现的新时代”。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e1f6f746996b7070",
      "translationZh": "值得注意的宣称结果：这些是由个别评论员报道的，尚未经过独立验证。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2a42c71374beb8c",
      "translationZh": "整数乘法：一位贡献者强调了一个比 n log n 更快的整数乘法结果。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5778e56716307735",
      "translationZh": "弹性逆问题：另一个指出了一个关于弹性逆问题的唯一性结果，该论文称这在 3D 中自 1994 年以来一直未解。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "979bf6b8effc8e45",
      "translationZh": "接近千禧年难题的工作：评论者指出在黎曼猜想、霍奇猜想和BSD猜想方面取得了部分进展。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6cbe20e1edb03fb",
      "translationZh": "数学家反应：Levent Alpöge赞扬了准黎曼和无西格尔零点（no-Siegel-zeros）的结果，并称其为“数学史上最重要的时刻”。他还指出了涉及其他实验室用户被抢发成果（scooping）和利益冲突的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dff69a87f7a18306",
      "translationZh": "结果构成：一项分析估计约20%的结果是反证或反例。该分析认为，这削弱了“AI数学胜利主要源于暴力搜索”的说法。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "657ebc4097539ca4",
      "translationZh": "怀疑与开放性问题：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "720b0d5d561ce702",
      "translationZh": "预期的错误：Will Depue预计某些结果无法经受住审查。他建立了citedbyagi.com来追踪该发布版本引用了哪些人类论文。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "534791305f0a2488",
      "translationZh": "算力框架：Teortaxes指出三小时的算力“并不多”。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2124517c583c7a1",
      "translationZh": "泛化能力：François Chollet询问在RLVR友好型数学和代码领域的提升是否具有泛化性，或者非可验证领域是否仍受限于人类数据。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2603c5bbff0b3132",
      "translationZh": "Mistral Large 4（”Le Chonk”）：发布、定价与有争议的评估",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5dbbf822c26757c",
      "translationZh": "Mistral Large 4 preview：该模型拥有 1T 总参数量和 49B 激活参数量，原生支持多模态，目前已可通过 API 使用（公告）。承诺将于 10 月底发布开放权重。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e12fbc0e5a5d22cf",
      "translationZh": "训练状态：强化学习（RL）运行“仍在进行中，且尚未表现出饱和迹象”。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "50fc85d68a835d02",
      "translationZh": "计算：该模型在欧洲约 3,800 个 Grace Blackwell 上进行了预训练和后训练。目前正在训练一个更大的模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b53d339e733a6805",
      "translationZh": "定价：每百万输入/输出 token 分别为 1.36/4.18，缓存输入为 0.14，且前两周可享受五折优惠（Artificial Analysis）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f7188144eb8f8ea",
      "translationZh": "上下文：Vals 和 Artificial Analysis 列出的上下文窗口为 512K。OpenRouter 列出的上下文为 1M，其中输出最多可达 256K。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c5facbcc8f9e9b20",
      "translationZh": "人工评估：Mistral 表示在人工评估中，其在 STEM、CAD 和金融领域的表现优于 GLM 5.3，并在智能体编程（agentic coding）方面表现相当。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59001d429e3afd72",
      "translationZh": "编码基准测试：报告显示其在 DeepSWE 上表现优于 GLM 5.3，在 Terminal-Bench 4 ( Rozière ) 上表现优于 Kimi K3。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf7d6d9e212e67b8",
      "translationZh": "盲审：在一次盲测的 Surge 代码审查中，它排名第二，仅次于 Opus 5 。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0735fd5ef8668eb7",
      "translationZh": "独立测量：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aef522deb429e48b",
      "translationZh": "Artificial Analysis：其在智能指数（Intelligence Index）上得分为 38 分，与 GPT-6 Luna（最高分）持平，并达到了美国和中国以外地区的最高得分。其在网络指数（Cyber Index）上得分为 50 分，在 CyberGym-E2E-AA 上得分为 82%。每项任务的成本为 1.13，是具有相似智能水平的开源模型的 4 倍以上。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e56017592ca75de7",
      "translationZh": "Vals：它在 HLAB 的开源权重模型排名中位列第 1，在 Vals 指数的所有开源模型中排名第 9。由于大量使用上下文，其单次测试成本被推高至 13.78 美元。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c611ce2229a307d8",
      "translationZh": "临床分诊：一名评估人员报告，在 669 项临床决策中，该模型并列排名第一，且未出现任何严重的遗漏。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d30363393363259c",
      "translationZh": "注意事项与分歧：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84f3dc11a5d0876a",
      "translationZh": "拒绝效应：Cline 将网络领先地位主要归功于更少的拒绝行为，并指出 Opus 5.5 和 Astra 大约有 40% 的任务被其自身的安全过滤器拦截。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc76fc860eb50ad9",
      "translationZh": "指数差距：批评人士指出，在 AA 的指数上，该模型的表现落后于 GLM-5.3 甚至 GLM-5.3-Flash 。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a36f908d029bdae",
      "translationZh": "开源权重主张：Hugging Face 的首席执行官指出，在权重发布之前，它还不算开源权重。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "080f17ddb721df15",
      "translationZh": "配置：Mistral 警告称，许多报告的失败源于未设置 reasoning_effort=\"high\" .",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9cca447e8e197099",
      "translationZh": "蒸馏假设：Yuchen Jin 推测（作为一种未经证实的观点），西方与中国开源模型之间的差距反映了中国实验室蒸馏 Anthropic 和 OpenAI 模型的能力。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e7515ce7251b557b",
      "translationZh": "开源权重与 API 模型发布：嵌入模型、图像模型、决策模型",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "121cd81ddab578ce",
      "translationZh": "EmbeddingGemma 2：Google 的首个原生多模态开源嵌入模型，在一个空间内涵盖了文本、代码、图像、视频和音频。它基于 Gemma 4 构建，并在 Apache 2.0 协议下发布（DeepMind）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bd5fcbadc5fd66aa",
      "translationZh": "规格：它是模块化的，具有 740M 全能型、440M 文本+视觉、570M 文本+音频和 270M 纯文本变体。它具有从 768 降至 128 的 Matryoshka 维度，8,192 的上下文长度，并在 MTEB Code 上据报提升了 +14%（Phil Schmid）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b5aa89fa86ca443",
      "translationZh": "占用空间：它使用大约 191–567MB 的活动 RAM，并且每次处理可支持长达 5.5 分钟的音频或 58 帧视频（Google）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9484f605ba5a7c14",
      "translationZh": "生态系统：Day-0 支持涵盖 llama.cpp , vLLM , Ollama 和 Unsloth 。它还可以在浏览器中通过 WebGPU 运行，每次查询耗时约 20–70ms 。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1fd8d6568a89430a",
      "translationZh": "Nano Banana 2.1：Google 更新后的图像模型正在 Gemini 应用、AI Studio、搜索和广告中逐步推出（Google）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "588b030626b44cf2",
      "translationZh": "定价：每张图像 0.034，而之前的 Pro 模型为 0.134，Google 表示其性能更优 ( Schmid )。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f2217692527bbd38",
      "translationZh": "竞技场结果：它在多图编辑方面排名第4，在文本生成图像方面排名第5，在图像编辑方面排名第6，在文本生成图像方面比 Nano Banana 2 高出 80 分（Arena）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fcb602ab2343bb30",
      "translationZh": "决策模型成为一个产品类别：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "44938a4bdb1b92ed",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI Decisions API：该公开测试版运行在 GPT-6 Luna 之上，并返回谓词、选项或评分。OpenAI 表示其速度比 Responses API 快高达 10 倍（OpenAI Devs）。定价从每百万次输入 0.10 美元起，且不收取输出费用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7624a4fe1fbe84c",
      "translationZh": "Perplexity：pplx-decider-v1.1-27b 是开源权重模型，输入成本为每百万 token 0.02 美元，并在新的 HF Decision Index v0.3 指数中排名第一。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d159da4deacd63cf",
      "translationZh": "对 Jev 的独立检查：Vals 发现 Jev 在声明验证方面的表现与 GPT-6 Astra 的 97.5% 持平，但成本仅为其约 1/500。Jev 在 LegalBench 上的排名也位列最后。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f90d3794beacd246",
      "translationZh": "怀疑论观点：Theo 认为模型路由（model-routing）用例在选择智能水平方面“绝对毫无用处”。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de35a8b9bd64c094",
      "translationZh": "Ling 3.1 Flash：该模型总参数量为 560B，激活参数量为 25B，在 AA 指数上的得分从 20 提升至 41。其每百万 token 的成本为 0.30/0.90，权重即将发布。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4264a61a7d6b8bce",
      "translationZh": "Reflection Beam：知乎的一份关于 Beam 的分析描述了一个拥有 23.8T 预训练 token 的 501B/23B MoE 模型。强化学习（RL）在约 10,500 个 GB300 上运行了四周，且训练能够容忍高达 10^7 个策略版本陈旧的样本。能力教师和对齐教师通过多教师在策略蒸馏（multi-teacher on-policy distillation）进行了合并。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b8524e57233196f9",
      "translationZh": "Kandinsky 6.0：该视频模型以 MIT 许可证发布，支持同步音频和 day-0 vLLM-Omni 支持。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f7b5ad6f49a4de56",
      "translationZh": "搜索评估：OpenAI 内置的网页搜索在 AA Search Index 上得分为 74，在供应商中排名第 5，每个任务耗时约 0.05。它在 BrowseComp 上表现最弱，在该项测试中 26 个模型中排名第 13。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b41e9c817ccb0ad7",
      "translationZh": "安全性、控制与评估完整性",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6387ea150d6a1d48",
      "translationZh": "控制干预感知：更新后的 CIAware 基准测试显示，GPT-6 Astra 在检测控制干预方面接近饱和。大多数模型在五月份时接近随机水平。作者认为这会泄露有关监控器信息并削弱控制协议（共同作者）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6e21a6fd4d2c7fab",
      "translationZh": "作为攻击面的可观测性：METR 警告称，对齐失当的智能体可能会黑入人类用于监督它们的日志审查工具。它建议将所有转录内容和操作视为不可信输入。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "034733b0a52d35a6",
      "translationZh": "Anthropic 网络验证计划：Anthropic 正在扩大 Mythos 5.1、Opus 5.5 和 Sonnet 5.5 对已验证防御者的访问权限。它正在为授权的攻击性工作（如渗透测试和红队测试）增加层级。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0798a931527428ec",
      "translationZh": "开源模型网络辩论：Arvind Narayanan 认为，GLM 5.3 数周未发生事故应该降低网络风险评估。Nathan Lambert 同样认为，在辩论中闭源模型的风险被低估了。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1cd238d4e071946c",
      "translationZh": "AutomationBench 已验证：对 Zapier 的 AutomationBench 进行审计后发现了 206 个验证器错误。修复这些错误后，在 1,235 次 Kimi K3 运行中，27.9% 的评分发生了变化。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "43b89ca08f5d19c2",
      "translationZh": "AI 作为领域主席：对所有 6,617 篇 ICML 2026 论文的 AI 排名显示与人类的一致性较弱，Kendall's τ ≈ 0.08。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2991f15205cb5d21",
      "translationZh": "智能体事故：一个主动型智能体以创始人身份将其银行余额发布到了公司的 Slack 频道中。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c1c6e087fa1a1352",
      "translationZh": "研究、基础设施与开发者工具",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d8e2ce71e76b077b",
      "translationZh": "H-JEPA：一种分层世界模型，在减少规划计算量的同时，将 Visual AntMaze 的成功率从 18% 提升至 73%。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "85242d2751a47a56",
      "translationZh": "基座模型中的提示词线索：在前面添加像“Okay”这样的线索，使 Olmo-3-7B 在 MATH-500 上的表现从 42% 提升到 78%。作者表示，强化学习（RL）主要使这类线索出现的概率更高。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29db746c7a7d5554",
      "translationZh": "Harness-Aware Distillation：该学生模型在未见的 ALFWorld 任务上达到了 63.4%，而最佳基线模型为 47.0%，并超过了其 8B 参数量的教师模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78a9b463c577d3df",
      "translationZh": "其他论文：亚马逊的循环扩散语言模型（looped diffusion LMs）、Meta 用于研究智能体的 MIRA 元推理器，以及通过压缩率来衡量 LLM 研究新颖性的 Priced Guidance。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3532749ea4f0648",
      "translationZh": "优化器声称：据报道，ANVIL III 在 124M 到 1.2B 参数规模下，比 Muon 的损失值低 0.020–0.028 nats。作者表示，这意味着在 8x-Chinchilla 配置下可以节省 50% 的计算量，且所需的调优量比 Muon 更少。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f0ccf4c7a7d10b52",
      "translationZh": "CoreWeave：其 RL Rollouts 功能的热交换权重速度比重新部署快约 15 倍。它被用于将 Nemotron 3.5 Lightning 在 BrowseComp 上的表现从 36.97% 提升至 45.45%。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7df9640ad9ee261e",
      "translationZh": "Scale AI：Scale 开源了 AgentEnv，这是其所有强化学习（RL）环境的基础。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c184a8f2128fdf4b",
      "translationZh": "Marin：Marin 535B-A23B 的公开训练运行已过半。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9fd8b461ff548d5",
      "translationZh": "Intel 18A 拆解：SemiAnalysis 拆解了 Intel 18A 的 PowerVia，这是首个商用背面供电技术。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4798ed21714ba8b",
      "translationZh": "ClusterMAX 评级：在发现 Slurm GPU 广告存在故障且 Kubernetes 中没有 RDMA 暴露后，它将 FarmGPU 评为“表现不佳”。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c9947de6b8d871e",
      "translationZh": "OSC 7501：Mitchell Hashimoto 发布了一个允许程序报告其状态的终端规范。他指出，目前有超过 250 个智能体编排器依赖启发式算法来判断像 Claude Code 这样的工具是在运行还是被阻塞。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b66b6e4922a5f979",
      "translationZh": "Bun：下一个版本将附带 bun check，这是一个用 Rust 编写的类型检查器。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "660bb5305bd50619",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI API 层级：OpenAI 将其付费层级从五个减少到三个；顶级的 Grow 层级现在要求累计支付达到 500 美元。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d814d24737ed91a9",
      "translationZh": "智能体产品：Codex Auto-review 现在免费提供，且其审查过程不消耗套餐额度。Claude Code 云端会话在全新的虚拟机上运行每个任务。Cursor 增加了来自 iOS 的远程智能体控制功能。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ecca382732a0a8c3",
      "translationZh": "中国芯片风险敞口：Epoch 研究发现，中国在半导体供应链冲击方面的风险敞口大约是美国的 2.7 倍。其脱钩模拟显示，中国实际总国民收入（GNE）下降约 3%，而美国下降约 0.6%。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35d5e0d968f4f34c",
      "translationZh": "中国 AI 营收：Epoch 的另一份报告梳理了中国 AI 企业的五种营收来源。报告指出，火山引擎在 2025 年供应了中国约 50% 的公有云 AI Token。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dfcbf992d9008a2a",
      "translationZh": "高通-华为澄清：高通告诉第一财经，有关其交易与华为 LogicFolding 技术相关的报道是不真实的。它还否认了有关其为净付款方的报道。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a57da4091884664b",
